    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπαίζω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-παίξομαι</span> (v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>jest, mock at</i>, c. gen., 
